	array( 'advisory-platform', 'Professional services platform', 'Professional services', 'building', 'A clear digital foundation for expertise-led organizations and complex service portfolios.', 'Expertise is often organized around internal departments while visitors need answers to specific business questions.', 'Service categories, structured detail pages, contextual articles, and a clear inquiry journey connect expertise with the questions a visitor is trying to answer.', 'A service map, messaging hierarchy, reusable service templates, and a clear review workflow keep information useful.' ),
